      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "315プロダクションのバスですよね。\nこちらの駐車場で、少々お待ちいただけますか？",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "スタッフ"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": false,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_10_b:step-6:text",
        "step_id": 6,
        "step_index": 5,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_10_b",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_10_b.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 34,
          "target_step_index": 5
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "実はまだ、関係者の受け入れ準備が出来ていなくて……\nあと30分、いえ40分は、ここで待機してください！",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "スタッフ"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": false,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_10_b:step-9:text",
        "step_id": 9,
        "step_index": 8,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_10_b",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_10_b.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 34,
          "target_step_index": 8
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "ええっ、そんなぁ！\nどうしましょう、●●●●プロデューサーさん。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "山村 賢"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_10_b:step-10:text",
        "step_id": 10,
        "step_index": 9,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_10_b",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_10_b.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 34,
          "target_step_index": 9
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "困りましたね。\nただでさえ、この先の道は混みやすいのに……。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "producer",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "<P>"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": false,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_10_b:step-11:text",
        "step_id": 11,
        "step_index": 10,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_10_b",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_10_b.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 34,
          "target_step_index": 10
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "（ですが……何分待たされようと、問題ありません。\nなぜならこのバスは、おとりですから！）",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "producer",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "<P>"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": false,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_10_b:step-14:text",
        "step_id": 14,
        "step_index": 13,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_10_b",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_10_b.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 34,
          "target_step_index": 13
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "……●●●●プロデューサーから連絡だ！　\nやっぱり、315プロのバスは足止めされたみたいだね。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "渡辺 みのり"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_10_b:step-20:text",
        "step_id": 20,
        "step_index": 19,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_10_b",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_10_b.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 34,
          "target_step_index": 19
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "でも、計画通り、2人が敵の目を欺いてくれてる。\n今のうちに、俺たちはステージに向かおう！",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "渡辺 みのり"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_10_b:step-21:text",
        "step_id": 21,
        "step_index": 20,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_10_b",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_10_b.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 34,
          "target_step_index": 20
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "次は曲がり角だな。\n硲サン、後ろは問題ないかい？",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "葛之葉 雨彦"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_10_b:step-26:text",
        "step_id": 26,
        "step_index": 25,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_10_b",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_10_b.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 34,
          "target_step_index": 25
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "うむ、問題ない。\n葛之葉君、素晴らしい安全運転だ！",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "硲 道夫"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_10_b:step-27:text",
        "step_id": 27,
        "step_index": 26,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_10_b",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_10_b.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 34,
          "target_step_index": 26
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "次郎、大丈夫か？\nそうそう、しっかり掴まっていてくれ！",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "信玄 誠司"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_10_b:step-30:text",
        "step_id": 30,
        "step_index": 29,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_10_b",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_10_b.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 34,
          "target_step_index": 29
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "道は混んでいるし、遠回りしているはずなのに、\nどんどん会場に近づいているぞ！",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "信玄 誠司"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_10_b:step-33:text",
        "step_id": 33,
        "step_index": 32,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_10_b",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_10_b.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 34,
          "target_step_index": 32
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "ふふっ。まずは第一関門、突破だね！",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "渡辺 みのり"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
